cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Predictive Authority Control: Constrained Residual Reinforcement Learning for Robust AUV Trajectory Tracking"
authors:
  - family-names: "Tian"
    given-names: "Jiacheng"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/Jiacheng-Tian/predictive-authority-control"
abstract: >-
  Predictive Authority Control (PAC) blends a sliding-mode primary
  controller and a model-predictive authority controller through a bounded,
  learned authority coefficient. A supervised Transformer stage is followed
  by a constrained residual reinforcement-learning stage whose correction is
  bounded and initialized to zero, so the deployed system starts numerically
  identical to the verified baseline.
keywords:
  - autonomous underwater vehicle
  - reinforcement learning
  - model predictive control
  - sliding-mode control
  - safe learning
license: MIT
